This project includes a modified version of the ASAM OpenSCENARIO 2 grammar
from PMSF py-osc2 (https://github.com/PMSFIT/py-osc2), which is licensed
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0).

Modifications:
- top-level `use` statement support
- spaced physical literals (e.g., `35 kph`)
- regeneration with ANTLR 4.13.2
- project-specific indentation helper

